  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Relief for Victims in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gift of the Givers relief intervention in Ukraine is focused on providing emergency relief items to orphans, elderly, families and individuals. We have mobilized volunteers within Ukraine thus broadening our reach within &quot;hot spots&quot;. Our immediate approach is a resourceful one given that many areas are no entry zones, and this includes the identifying of specific needs, locating shops &amp; suppliers, providing funding, &amp; immediate delivery of aid from within.</narrative>
  </description>
